# landmark (assets/world3d/rookery/landmark.set, hand-placed)
# Rookery Pass: the Royal Bird Office's pigeon loft with its rows of holes and a second dovecote, between two crags of the pass.
# Hand-placed by the landmark pass on the room's blocked back band and what lies behind it,
# so it never stands on a tile a knight walks or hides the floor from the camera.

# the loft tower: stone, a slate spire, rows of pigeon-holes and a ledge
box    stone   at 232 0 0 size 44 56 28 id lm-loft
pyramid slate   at 232 56 0 size 52 18 32
